{
  "nav": "Keybindings",
  "title": "Keybindings",
  "intro": "raven.bind assigns an action to a key combination. Reusing a combination replaces its binding.",
  "keywords": [
    "keys",
    "shortcuts",
    "super",
    "shift",
    "ctrl",
    "actions",
    "vt",
    "spawn",
    "applications",
    "arguments",
    "alt",
    "tab",
    "switcher"
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Binding"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "text": "raven.bind(\"Super+Return\", \"terminal\")",
      "language": "Lua"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Combine Super, Shift, Ctrl, and Alt with +. Key names include Return, space, F2, plus, and XF86AudioRaiseVolume. Use an unshifted key name with an explicit Shift modifier."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Launching applications"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Put the application’s executable name in spawn."
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "Lua",
      "text": "raven.bind(\"Super+E\", { spawn = { \"nautilus\" } })"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "To pass arguments, add each one as a separate entry after the executable."
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "Lua",
      "text": "raven.bind(\"Super+E\", { spawn = { \"nautilus\", \"--new-window\" } })"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Replace nautilus with your application’s executable and use arguments it supports. Keep an argument containing spaces in one quoted entry. These examples use the same shortcut; choose one, then save to apply it."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Application switcher"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Hold Alt and press Tab to select the next application. Alt+Shift+Tab goes backward. Release Alt to focus the selected application’s most recently focused window, including windows on other workspaces. Escape cancels without changing focus."
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "Lua",
      "text": "raven.bind(\"Alt+Tab\", \"next_app\")\nraven.bind(\"Alt+Shift+Tab\", \"previous_app\")"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "These bindings are enabled by default and must include Alt. Holding Tab uses your keyboard repeat settings. While the switcher is open, the arrow keys also change selection; hovering an icon selects it, clicking confirms, and clicking outside cancels."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Windows are grouped by application ID and listed in recent-focus order. Applications without mapped windows are not shown. Names and icons come from installed desktop entries and the icon theme; unidentified applications use a fallback."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "If another fullscreen window hides the target on its workspace, Raven requests fullscreen exit before focusing the target."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Actions"
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "label": "Binding actions",
      "headers": [
        "Action",
        "Argument",
        "Effect"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "terminal / launcher",
          "None",
          "Run the configured terminal or launcher."
        ],
        [
          "close",
          "None",
          "Close the focused window."
        ],
        [
          "fullscreen / floating",
          "None",
          "Toggle the focused window’s mode."
        ],
        [
          "screenshot",
          "None",
          "Open the native area selector."
        ],
        [
          "next_app / previous_app",
          "None",
          "Select the next / previous application. The binding must include Alt."
        ],
        [
          "quit",
          "None",
          "Exit Raven."
        ],
        [
          "reload",
          "None",
          "Reload the configuration."
        ],
        [
          "workspace",
          "1 to 10",
          "Switch workspace."
        ],
        [
          "move_to_workspace",
          "1 to 10",
          "Move the focused window."
        ],
        [
          "vt",
          "1 to 12",
          "Switch virtual terminal."
        ],
        [
          "{ spawn = { ... } }",
          "Executable and arguments",
          "Launch a command. Not preflight-checked on reload."
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "text": "raven.bind(\"Super+2\", \"workspace\", 2)\nraven.bind(\"Super+Shift+2\", \"move_to_workspace\", 2)\nraven.bind(\"Ctrl+Alt+F2\", \"vt\", 2)",
      "language": "Lua"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Removing bindings"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "text": "raven.unbind(\"Super+Q\")",
      "language": "Lua"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Other bindings remain unchanged. raven.clear_bindings() removes every configured binding, including quit and VT switching; add any required recovery bindings afterward."
    },
